          },
          {
            "id": "beat-yolks",
            "kind": "mise",
            "text": "Beat the egg yolks slightly — only enough to break them up and blend them to one even colour. Do not beat them light and foamy: a slightly beaten egg is what gives the finished custard its smooth, thick consistency.",
            "label": "beat egg yolks",
            "ingredientIdx": [
              1
