            "cue": "until the sugar is dissolved and the mixture is even"
          },
          {
            "id": "temper-yolks",
            "kind": "cook",
            "text": "Stir constantly while you add the hot milk to the yolk mixture — a spoonful or two at a time at first, then in a thin steady stream. Never stop stirring while the milk is going in.",
            "label": "temper yolks",
            "ingredientIdx": [
