          {
            "id": "heat-iron-1",
            "kind": "cook",
            "text": "A waffle-iron should fit closely on the range. It is heated well on one side, turned, and heated on the other side, and it must be thoroughly greased before the iron is filled. With a new iron, special care must be taken in greasing, or the waffles will stick.",
